  "properties": {
    "encrypted": "false",
    "long_instructions": "# Build the For You Feed\r\n\r\n## Do This:\r\n\r\nIn `script.js`, complete `buildForYouFeed()` so it builds a custom For You feed from `allPosts`.\r\n\r\n\r\n### 1. Explore the data and decide your goal\r\n* Inspect the `data.js` file, and decompose ways that you might filter and sort this data.\r\n* Decide what your algorithm values most.\r\n\r\n*(Ex: popularity -> sort by likes, virality -> sort by shares)*\r\n\r\n### 2. Create a filter function\r\n* Determine how you want to filter this data \r\n* Work with AI Tutor to implement a filtering function.\r\n\r\n### 3. Create a sort function\r\n* Sort the data that remains by an algorithm of your design.\r\n* Work with AI Tutor to implement a sorting function.\r\n\r\n\r\n### 4. Build the pipeline\r\n* Connect the pipeline at the bottom: sort > filter > render\r\n\r\n*Test your feed by clicking **Refresh Feed**. Check that the feed shows the posts you want, hides the posts you do not want, and appears in the order you chose.*\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n",
